# Wrap Sketch Onto Face (an extension): with nothing selected the menu
# says what to select; with the cylinder of path_wrap picked, the
# sketch's rectangle is raised from it and the group screen shows the
# face, the height and raised or sunk. Analyze > Check Solid finds it
# sound; the height takes an expression, and sunk engraves the face.
key r
move 250 200
down L 250 200
up L 250 200
move 350 250
down L 350 250
up L 350 250
key esc
move 300 250
down L 300 250
up L 300 250
key l shift
key esc
move 250 200
down L 250 200
up L 250 200
key w shift
view default
menu View|Show|Construction Entities
key r
move 275 215
down L 275 215
up L 275 215
move 295 235
down L 295 235
up L 295 235
key esc
menu View|Show|Construction Entities
answer ok
menu Features|Wrap Sketch Onto Face
menu View|Show|Selectable Faces
move 330 280
down L 330 280
up L 330 280
menu Features|Wrap Sketch Onto Face
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 160 145
twdown L 160 145
twup L 160 145
edit 1+1
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 140 165
twdown L 140 165
twup L 140 165
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
